# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive fixture: DO routes through BRCE + ReceiptDAG; direct execution and hooks stay unauthorized.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
dfcm:DO dfcm:authorityRoute dfcm:BRCE ; dfcm:receiptRoute dfcm:ReceiptDAG .
dfcm:DirectExecution dfcm:mayActuate false .
dfcm:IntentHook dfcm:mayActuate false .
